2. Spec Acceptance Criterion 8 explicitly requires running `agent-verify --jev-only (no paid review)` and reporting counts, logs, mutation/restoration, fixture metadata, and limits. Plan Step 6 covers evidence archival and doc updates, but omits `agent-verify --jev-only`.
