    [major] Plan Step 2 (inspecting CMFormatDescription) — Plan specifies inspecting 'BitsPerComponent' on CMFormatDescription. CoreMedia has no kCMFormatDescriptionExtension_BitsPerComponent; format description depth is accessed via kCMFormatDescriptionExtension_Depth or AVMediaCharacteristicContainsHDRVideo. Referencing BitsPerComponent as a CMFormatDescription extension will fail compilation.
